      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can see this being useful in another couple of ways.\nThe menu should make it so that in order to block a friend, a prompt should show up to unfriend, and it wouldn't block unless you unfriended them.\nI could see them suggesting a block 'time' so that you can have a user automatically unblocked when you leave the instance, or the next time that you log in rather than having blocks be indefinite.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
