  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-12T01:15:50.751Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to see who of my friends list has me currently blocked.\nEither to remove them from the friends list or just to be sure what actually happened.\nSometimes people block for fun/jokes and forget about it, thinking that you are just gone.\n(Basically being drunk and not remembering that you blocked your long time friend as a joke on the day after the hangover, for example)\nThat feature I like to see, would maybe give you the option to contact them somewhere else or ask someone who knows them to unblock you if it was by accident or joke.\nIt is currently just confusing and stressful to find out what happend when you come back to your senses after a night of drinking. :/",
